※ pl4g-test: compile=error diag=4570

※ A reference brought in by value reaches the variable it names, as one brought
※ in by reference does: the lambda may not be given to a name that outlives it.

@[startup, impure]
fn main() → u6:
    let g: mut fn() → u8 = λ → u8 { 0u8 }
    if g() = 0u8:
        let n: u8 = 1u8
        let r: &u8 = &n
        g ← λ [r] → u8 { r }
    g()
    0u6
